      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>Makeup</strong><div style="margin-top:0.35rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Coming soon — expressive color, easy application.</div></div>
      <div style="background:hsl(var(--secondary)); padding:1.5rem; border-radius:1.5rem;"><strong>Skincare</strong><div style="margin-top:0.35rem; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.75);">Coming soon — care that feels as good as it works.</div></div>
